.TH MOCHI-MANAGER-LEGACY 1 "2026-09-28" "Mochi @VERSION@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mochi-manager-legacy \- open the temporary GTK3 Manager fallback
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mochi-manager-legacy
.SH DESCRIPTION
Starts the frozen GTK3 compatibility Manager. It shares the user's saved
Themes and preferences with the GTK4 Manager. Use the normal Manager for
current features.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mochi-manager (1)
